{
  "title": "Output Validation vs Perturbation on a toy workbook",
  "instructions": "This is a **made-up five-cell model**, not one of the paper's tasks: Year-2 revenue = Year-1 revenue × (1 + 5% growth), and EBITDA = Year-2 revenue × 30% margin.\n\n1. With the build set to *formulas*, press **Run the judge's checks**. Both checks pass.\n2. Switch the build to *Year-2 revenue typed in as a number* and run the checks again. Output Validation still passes, but Perturbation fails.\n3. Move the revenue slider yourself and watch which cells respond in each build.\n\nThe check steps copy the procedure in the paper's judge prompt: read the output, change the input, recalculate, read again, restore.",
  "html": "<div id=\"bw\"><div class=\"row\"><label for=\"mode\">Agent's build:</label><select id=\"mode\"><option value=\"dyn\">Formulas all the way down</option><option value=\"hard\">Year-2 revenue typed in as a number</option></select></div><div class=\"row\"><label for=\"rev\">Year-1 revenue (B1):</label><input type=\"range\" id=\"rev\" min=\"80\" max=\"200\" step=\"10\" value=\"100\"><output id=\"revo\">100</output></div><table id=\"tbl\"></table><div class=\"row\">Year-2 EBITDA (B5): <output id=\"ebo\"></output></div><div class=\"track\"><div id=\"bar\" class=\"bar\"></div></div><div class=\"row\"><button id=\"run\" class=\"primary\">Run the judge's checks</button></div><div id=\"log\"></div></div><style>#bw{font-size:14px;color:var(--fg)}#bw .row{margin:6px 0;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;align-items:center}#bw table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;margin:8px 0}#bw td,#bw th{border:1px solid var(--border);padding:4px 6px;text-align:left}#bw th{background:var(--surface)}#bw .hard{color:var(--series-2);font-weight:bold}#bw .track{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:3px;height:16px}#bw .bar{height:100%;background:var(--series-1);border-radius:3px}#bw #log{white-space:pre-wrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:12px;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);padding:6px;min-height:40px;margin-top:6px}</style><script>(function(){var mode=document.getElementById('mode'),rev=document.getElementById('rev'),revo=document.getElementById('revo'),tbl=document.getElementById('tbl'),log=document.getElementById('log'),run=document.getElementById('run'),bar=document.getElementById('bar'),ebo=document.getElementById('ebo');function calc(r,m){var y2=m==='dyn'?r*1.05:105;return {y2:y2,eb:y2*0.3};}function fmt(x){return x.toFixed(2);}function render(){var r=+rev.value,m=mode.value,c=calc(r,m);revo.textContent=r;var rows=[['B1','Year-1 revenue (input)',String(r),'typed input'],['B2','Growth rate (input)','5%','typed input'],['B3','Year-2 revenue',fmt(c.y2),m==='dyn'?'=B1*(1+B2)':'105 (typed constant)'],['B4','EBITDA margin (input)','30%','typed input'],['B5','Year-2 EBITDA',fmt(c.eb),'=B3*B4']];var h='<tr><th>Cell</th><th>Line item</th><th>Value</th><th>Contents</th></tr>';rows.forEach(function(x){var hard=(x[0]==='B3'&&m!=='dyn');h+='<tr><td>'+x[0]+'</td><td>'+x[1]+'</td><td>'+x[2]+'</td><td'+(hard?' class=\"hard\"':'')+'>'+x[3]+'</td></tr>';});tbl.innerHTML=h;bar.style.width=Math.min(100,c.eb/70*100)+'%';ebo.textContent=fmt(c.eb);}function within(a,b){return Math.abs(a-b)/b<=0.02;}run.addEventListener('click',function(){var m=mode.value,L=[];L.push('Delivered workbook: B1 = 100.');var base=calc(100,m).eb;L.push('Output Validation: is B5 within 2% of 31.50? Read '+fmt(base)+' -> '+(within(base,31.5)?'PASS':'FAIL'));L.push('Perturbation: 1) read B5 = '+fmt(base)+'  2) set B1 to 150  3) recalc_workbook');var p=calc(150,m).eb;L.push('  4) read B5 = '+fmt(p)+'; expected within 2% of 47.25 -> '+(within(p,47.25)?'PASS':'FAIL'));L.push('  5) restore B1 = 100 and recalc.');log.textContent=L.join('\\n');rev.value=100;render();});mode.addEventListener('change',function(){render();log.textContent='Press the button to run the checks on this build.';});rev.addEventListener('input',render);render();log.textContent='Press the button to run the checks on this build.';})();</script>"
}
